hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"156","Hafs bin Umar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Umar bin al-Fazl ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Nuaim bin Yazid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Talib salawatullahi alaihi ne hum se hadees bayan ki ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam jab sakht beemar ho gaye to farmaya: Ae Ali, mere paas ek tabaq lao main us mein woh likh doon jis se meri ummat mere baad gumrah na ho, to mujhe darr hua ke koi mujh par sabqat le jayega to maine arz kiya: Beshak main saheefe ko apne dono bazuaon se barh kar yaad rakhne wala hoon, aur un ka sar mere bazoo aur بازو ke darmiyan tha, to woh namaz aur zakat aur jo tumhare dayen haath malik hue un ke baare mein wasiyyat farmane lage, aur isi tarah farmate rahe hatta ke un ki rooh parwaz kar gayi, aur unhon ne is gawahi ka hukm diya ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahin aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain, jo in dono ki gawahi de ga woh aag par haram kar diya jayega."
"157","Muhammad bin Sabiq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Israeel ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Aamash se, Abu Wail se, Abdullah se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Bulane wale ki dawat qabool karo, aur tohfa wapas na karo, aur Musalmanon ko na maro."
"158","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Fuzail ne humein khabar di, Mughira se, Umm Musa se, Ali salawatullahi alaihi se riwayat hai unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka aakhri kalam yeh tha: Namaz, namaz, Allah se daro us mein jis ke tumhare dayen haath malik hue."
"159","Abdullah bin Saleh ne hum se hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Saleh ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Rahman bin Jubair bin Nufair se, un ke walid se, Abu Darda se riwayat hai ke woh logon se kehte the: Hum tum ko janwaron ke tabibon se zyada pehchante hain jo dawab ko pehchante hain, hum ne tumhare achhon ko tumhare buron me se pehchan liya hai. Rahe tumhare achhe log to woh hai jis ke khair ki ummeed rakhi jati hai aur jis ke shar se aman paya jata hai. Aur rahe tumhare bure log to woh hai jis ke khair ki ummeed na rakhi jati ho aur jis ke shar se aman na paya jata ho aur jis ka aazad karda aazad na ho."
"160","Isam bin Khalid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Huraiz bin Usman ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ibn Hani se, Abu Umama se riwayat hai, maine unhein kehte hue suna: Kanood woh hai jo apna atiyya rokta hai, aur akele utarta hai, aur apne ghulam ko marta hai."
"161","Hajjaj bin Minhal ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Ali bin Zaid se, Saeed bin al-Musayyib se, aur Hammad se, Habib se, aur Humaid se, Hasan se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne apne ghulam ko hukm diya ke woh apne oont par pani khenche, to ghulam so gaya, to woh aag ka shola laya aur us ko us ke chehre par daal diya, to ghulam kunwein mein gir gaya, to jab subah hui to woh Umar bin Khattab raziyallahu anhu ke paas aaya, to unhon ne woh dekha jo us ke chehre mein tha, to unhon ne us ko aazad kar diya."
"162","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yahya bin Saeed se, Ibn Amra se, Amra se riwayat hai ke Aisha raziyallahu anha ne apni ek laundi ko mudabbar bana diya tha, to Aisha beemar ho gayin, to un ke bhai ke beton ne Zutt qaum ke ek tabib se pucha, to us ne kaha: Tum mujhe ek jadu zada aurat ke baare mein bata rahe ho, us par us ki ek laundi ne jadu kiya hai, to Aisha ko khabar di gayi, unhon ne kaha: Tune mujh par jadu kiya hai? To us ne kaha: Haan, to unhon ne kaha: Aur kyun? Tu kabhi najaat na payegi, phir unhon ne kaha: Us ko Arab ke badtareen shakhs ke haath milkiyat bana kar bech do."
"163","Hajjaj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hammad jo Ibn Salama hain ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ghalib ne humein khabar di, Abu Umama se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam tashreef laye un ke saath do ghulam the, to unhon ne ek Ali salawatullahi alaihi ko hadiya kar diya, aur farmaya: Us ko na marna, kyunke mujhe namaz padhne walon ko marne se mana kiya gaya hai, aur jab se hum aaye hain maine us ko namaz padhte hue dekha hai, aur Abu Zarr ko ek ghulam diya, aur farmaya: Us ke saath bhalai ki wasiyyat qabool kar to unhon ne us ko aazad kar diya, to unhon ne farmaya: Us ne kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne mujhe hukm diya tha ke main us ke saath bhalai ki wasiyyat par amal karoon to maine us ko aazad kar diya."
"164","Abu Mamar ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Waris ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Aziz ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Anas se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam Madina tashreef laye aur Aap ke paas koi khadim na tha, to Abu Talha ne mera haath pakda, phir mujhe le kar chale hatta ke mujhe Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas dakhil kar diya, to unhon ne arz kiya: Ae Allah ke Nabi, beshak Anas samajhdar zaheen ladka hai, pas woh Aap ki khidmat kare. Unhon ne kaha: To maine safar aur hazar mein Un ki khidmat ki, Madina mein Un ke tashreef lane se le kar hatta ke woh sallallahu alaihi wasallam wafaat pa gaye, Unhon ne mujhe kisi kaam par jo maine kiya yeh na kaha: Tune yeh is tarah kyun kiya? Aur na mujhe kisi kaam par jo maine na kiya yeh kaha: Tune yeh is tarah kyun na kiya?"
"165","Musaddad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Umar bin Abi Salama se, un ke walid se, Abu Huraira se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Jab ghulam chori kare to us ko bech do agarche ek nash ke badle ho. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Nash bees hai. Aur nawat paanch hai. Aur ooqiya chalees hai."
"166","Ahmad bin Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, Dawood bin Abdur Rahman ne hadees bayan ki unhon ne kaha: Maine Ismail se suna, Asim bin Laqit bin Sabira se, un ke walid se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas pahuncha, aur charwahe ne baade mein bakri ka bacha daakhil kiya, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: La tahsibanna gumaan na karo, aur La tahsabanna nahin kaha ke hamare paas sau bakriyan hain hum nahin chahte ke woh barhen, pas jab charwaha bakri ke bache ke saath aata hai hum us ki jagah ek bakri zibah kar dete hain, to Un ke farman me se tha: Apni biwi ko apni laundi ko marne ki tarah na mar, aur jab naak mein pani dalo to mubalagha karo magar yeh ke tum rozedar ho."
"167","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalda ne humein khabar di, Abu al-Aliya se riwayat hai unhon ne kaha: Humein hukm diya jata tha ke hum khadim par muhar lagayen, aur naapen, aur ginen, is na pasand se ke woh bure akhlaq ke aadi ho jayen, ya hum me se koi bura gumaan kare."
"168","Abu Nu'aim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Israel ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Haritha bin Muzarrib se, Hazrat Salman se, unhon ne farmaya: Beshak main apne khadim par haddiyan shumar karta hun badgumani ke khauf se."
"169","Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Haritha bin Muzarrib ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Salman ko suna: Beshak main badgumani ke dar se haddiyan shumar karta hun."
"170","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhrama bin Bukair ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar ne apne ek ghulam ko sona ya chandi de kar bheja to us ne use tabdeel kiya phir tabdeel me muhlat di phir us ki taraf wapas aaya to unhon ne use dardnak mara aur farmaya: Jao jo mera hai wo le lo aur use tabdeel na karo."
"171","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiya ne hamen khabar di, Amash se, Ibrahim Taimi se, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Masud se, unhon ne farmaya: Main apne ek ghulam ko maar raha tha to maine apne peeche se ek awaz suni: Aye Abu Masud jaan lo Allah tum par tum se zyada qadir hai jitne tum is par ho phir maine mur kar dekha to wo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam the maine arz kiya: Aye Allah ke Rasool phir wo Allah ki raza ke liye aazad hai to unhon ne farmaya: Khabardar agar tum ne aisa na kiya hota to aag tumhe zaroor chhu leti ya aag tumhe jhulsa deti."
"172","Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaina ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Saeed se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Na kaho: Allah us ka chehra qabeh kare."
"173","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Uyaina ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Saeed se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne farmaya: Hargiz na kaho: Allah tera chehra aur us ke chehre ko qabeh kare jis ka chehra tere chehre se mushtaba ho pas beshak Allah azza wa jalla ne Adam sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko us ki surat par paida kiya."
"174","Khalid bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ajlan ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe mere walid ne aur Saeed ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se khabar di, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne khadim ko mare to chehre se bache."
"175","Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Zubair se, Hazrat Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ka guzar ek janwar ke paas se hua jise dagha gaya tha aur us ke nathne dhuan de rahe the to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Allah us par lanat kare jis ne ye kiya koi shakhs chehre ko na daghe aur na use mare."
"176","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shoba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Husain ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hilal bin Yasaf ko kehte suna: Hum Suwaid bin Muqarrin ke ghar me kapra bechte the to ek laundi bahar nikli to us ne ek admi se kuch kaha to us admi ne use thappad mara to Suwaid bin Muqarrin ne us se kaha: Kya tum ne us ke chehre par thappad mara beshak maine khud ko saat me se satwan paya aur hamare paas ek khadim ke siwa kuch na tha to hum me se ek ne use thappad mara to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use hukm diya ke use aazad kar de."
"177","Amr bin Aun aur Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, Firas se, Abu Salih se, Zazan se, Hazrat Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate suna: Jo apne ghulam ko thappad mare ya use had ke taur par mare jo us ne na kiya ho to us ka kaffara use aazad karna hai."
"178","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, unhon ne kaha: Salama bin Kuhail ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bin Suwaid bin Muqarrin ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine apne ek ghulam ko thappad mara to wo bhag gaya to mere walid ne mujhe bulaya phir us se kaha: Badla le lo hum Muqarrin ki aulad saat the hamare paas ek khadima thi to hum me se ek ne use thappad mara to is ka zikr Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kiya gaya to unhon ne farmaya: Unhe hukm do ke use aazad kar den to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se kaha gaya: Un ke paas us ke siwa koi khadim nahi unhon ne farmaya: Phir wo us se khidmat len phir jab us se be niyaz ho jayen to us ka rasta chhor den."
"179","Amr bin Marzuq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shoba ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Munkadir ne mujh se kaha: Tumhara naam kya hai to maine kaha: Shoba unhon ne kaha: Abu Shoba ne mujh se bayan kiya, Suwaid bin Muqarrin Muzani se, aur unhon ne ek admi ko dekha jis ne apne ghulam ko thappad mara tha to unhon ne farmaya: Kya tumhe malum na tha ke surat muharram hai maine khud ko Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke zamane me saat bhaiyon me satwan paya hamare paas ek khadim ke siwa kuch na tha to hum me se ek ne use thappad mara to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne hamen hukm diya ke use aazad karen."
"180","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awana ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Firas ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Salih se, Abu Salih ne Zazan Abu Umar se, unhon ne kaha: hum Ibn Umar ke paas the, to unhon ne apne ek ghulam ko bulaya jise unhon ne mara tha, phir us ki peeth se kapra hataya aur farmaya: kya tumhen dard ho raha hai, us ne kaha: nahin, to unhon ne use azaad kar diya, phir zameen se ek lakri uthayi aur farmaya: is silsile mein mujhe is lakri ke wazan ke barabar bhi ajar hasil nahin hai, to main ne kaha: ai Abu Abdur Rahman, aap ye kyun keh rahe hain, unhon ne kaha: main ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna ya unhon ne kaha: jo shakhs apne ghulam ko kisi had par mare jo us ne ki hi na ho, ya us ke chehre par thappad mare, to us ka kaffara ye hai ke use azaad kare."
"181","Muhammad bin Yusuf aur Qabisa ne hum se bayan kiya, un dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib bin Abi Sabit se, unhon ne Maimun bin Abi Shabib se, unhon ne Ammar bin Yasir se, unhon ne kaha: jo shakhs apne kisi ghulam ko mare jabke wo us par zulm karne wala ho to qayamat ke din us se us ka badla liya jayega."
"182","Abu Umar Hafs bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Jafar ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Abu Laila ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Salman bahar nikle to un ki sawari ka chara kundaal se gir raha tha, to unhon ne apne khadim se kaha: agar mujhe qisas ka khauf na hota to main tumhen zaroor takleef pahunchata."
"183","Abu Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: tum zaroor haq walon ko un ke huqooq ada karoge, yahan tak ke beghair seeng wali bakri ko seeng wali bakri se badla dilaya jayega."
"184","Abdullah bin Muhammad Jufi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud bin Abi Abdullah jo Bani Hashim ke azaad karda ghulam hain unhon ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Muhammad ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: meri dadi ne mujhe khabar di, Umm Salama se, ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam un ke ghar mein the, to unhon ne apni ya un ki ek khadima ko bulaya to us ne der lagayi, to aap ke chehre mein gussa zahir hua, to Umm Salama parde ki taraf uthin, to unhon ne khadima ko khelte hue paya, aur aap ke paas miswak thi, to aap ne farmaya: agar qayamat ke din badle ka khauf na hota to main tumhen is miswak se takleef pahunchata."
"185","Muhammad bin Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, unhon ne Zurara bin Awfa se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: jis ne koi maar mari us se qayamat ke din us ka badla liya jayega."
"186","Khalifa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Raja ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awwam ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Shaqiq se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, unhon ne farmaya: jis ne zulm ke taur par koi maar mari us se qayamat ke din us ka badla liya jayega."
"187","Muhammad bin Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hatim bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Yaqub bin Mujahid Abu Hazra se, unhon ne Ubada bin al-Walid bin Ubada bin Samit se, unhon ne kaha: main aur mere walid ilm hasil karne ke liye Ansar ke is mohalle mein nikle, un ke khatm hone se pehle, to sab se pehle jin se hum mile wo Abu al-Yasar the jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahabi hain aur un ke sath un ka ek ghulam tha, aur Abu al-Yasar par ek chadar aur maafiri kapra tha, aur un ke ghulam par bhi ek chadar aur maafiri kapra tha, to main ne un se kaha: ai chacha, agar aap apne ghulam ki chadar le len aur use apna maafiri kapra de den, ya us ka maafiri kapra le len aur use apni chadar de den, to aap par ek jora ho jayega ya us par ek jora ho jayega, to unhon ne mere sar par hath phera aur kaha: ai Allah is mein barkat de, ai mere bhatije, meri in dono aankhon ne dekha, aur mere in dono kanon ne suna, aur mere dil ne use yaad rakha aur unhon ne apne dil ki ragon ki taraf ishara kiya ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam farmate hain: unhen us mein se khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhen us mein se pehnao jo tum pehente ho, aur use duniya ke saman mein se kuch de dena mujhe is se zyada aasan hai ke wo qayamat ke din meri nekiyon mein se le le."
"188","Said bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fazl bin Mubashshir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghulamon ke bare mein bhalayi ki wasiyat farmate the aur farmate the: unhen us mein se khilao jo tum khate ho, aur unhen apne libas mein se pehnao, aur Allah azza wa jall ki makhlooq ko azab na do."
"189","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wasil Ahdab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Marur bin Suwaid ko kehte hue suna: main ne Hazrat Abu Dharr ko dekha aur un par ek jora tha aur un ke ghulam par bhi ek jora tha, to hum ne un se is ke bare mein poocha, to unhon ne kaha: main ne ek shakhs ko bura bhala kaha to us ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se meri shikayat ki, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne mujh se farmaya: kya tum ne use us ki maan ka taana diya, main ne kaha: ji han, phir aap ne farmaya: tumhare bhai tumhare khadim hain, Allah ne unhen tumhare hathon ke neeche kar diya hai, to jis ka bhai us ke hath ke neeche ho use chahiye ke use us mein se khilaye jo wo khata hai, aur use us mein se pehnaye jo wo pehenta hai, aur un par wo bojh na dalo jo un par ghalib aa jaye, phir agar tum un par wo bojh dalo jo un par ghalib aa jaye to un ki madad karo."
"190","Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bishr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sallam bin Amr ko bayan karte hue suna, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tumhare ghulam tumhare bhai hain, to un se acha sulook karo, jo kaam tum par bhari ho us par un se madad lo, aur jo kaam un par bhari ho us par un ki madad karo."
"191","Yahya bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr ne humen khabar di, Abu Yunus se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: kaam karne wale ki us ke kaam mein madad karo, kyunke Allah ke liye kaam karne wala nakam nahin hota, yani khadim murad hai."
"192","Abdullah bin Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne mujh se bayan kiya, Bukair bin Abdullah se, Ajlan se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur us ka libas hai, aur use kaam me se us cheez ki takleef nahi di jayegi jis ki woh taqat nahi rakhta."
"193","Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Laith ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Ajlan ne mujh se bayan kiya, Bukair se, ke Ajlan Abu Muhammad ne apni wafat se qabl un se hadith bayan ki, ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Ghulam ke liye us ka khana aur us ka libas hai, aur use siwaye us ke takleef nahi di jayegi jitni woh taqat rakhta ho."
"194","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne Aamash se hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Marur ne kaha: Hum Hazrat Abu Dharr ke paas se guzre aur un par ek kapra tha aur un ke ghulam par ek hulla tha, to hum ne kaha: Agar aap ye le len aur ise koi aur de den to hulla ho jayega, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tumhare bhai hain jinhen Allah ne tumhare hathon ke neeche kar diya hai, pas jis ka bhai us ke hath ke neeche ho to use chahiye ke use khilaye us me se jo woh khata hai, aur use pehnaye us me se jo woh pehenta hai, aur use us cheez ki takleef na de jo us par ghalib aa jaye, pas agar use aisi cheez ki takleef de jo us par ghalib aa jaye to use chahiye ke us par us ki madad kare."
"195","Ibrahim bin Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Baqiyya ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Bahir bin Saad ne mujhe khabar di, Khalid bin Maadan se, Miqdam se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko farmate hue suna: Jo tum ne apni jaan ko khilaya to woh sadqa hai, aur jo tum ne apne bete aur apni biwi aur apne khadim ko khilaya to woh sadqa hai."
"196","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne Asim bin Bahdala se hadith bayan ki, Abu Salih se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqa woh hai jo beniyazi baqi rakhe, aur upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur us se shuru karo jis ki tum kifalat karte ho, tumhari biwi kehti hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe talaq do, aur tumhara ghulam kehta hai: Mujh par kharch karo ya mujhe bech do, aur tumhara beta kehta hai: Hamen kis ke supurd karte ho."
"197","Muhammad bin Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne Muhammad bin Ajlan se khabar di, Maqburi se, Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne sadqe ka hukm diya, to ek shakhs ne kaha: Mere paas ek dinar hai, Aap ne farmaya: Use apni jaan par kharch karo, us ne kaha: Mere paas aur hai, Aap ne farmaya: Use apni biwi par kharch karo, us ne kaha: Mere paas aur hai, Aap ne farmaya: Use apne khadim par kharch karo, phir tum zyada janne wale ho."
"198","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhlad bin Zaid ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Juraij ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Zubair ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne ek shakhs ko Hazrat Jabir se admi ke khadim ke bare me sawal karte hue suna, jab woh use mashaqqat aur garmi se kifayat kar jaye, kya Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne use bulane ka hukm diya hai, unhon ne kaha: Haan, pas agar tum me se koi napasand kare ke woh us ke sath khaye to use chahiye ke use apne hath me ek luqma khilaye."
"199","Abdullah bin Maslama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Marwan bin Muawiya ne Fazl bin Mubashshir se hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ghulamon ke bare me bhalai ki wasiyat farmate the aur farmate the: Unhen khilao us me se jo tum khate ho, aur unhen pehnao tumhare libas me se, aur Allah ki makhluq ko azab na do."
"200","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya bin Saeed ne Ismail bin Abi Khalid se hadith bayan ki, un ke walid se, Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se kisi ke paas us ka khadim us ka khana le kar aaye to use chahiye ke use bithaye, pas agar woh qubul na kare to use chahiye ke use us me se de."
"201","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Yunus Basri ne Ibn Abi Mulaika se khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mahzura ne kaha: Main Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ke paas baitha tha, jab Safwan bin Umayya ek bara bartan le kar aaye jise chand admi ek aba me utha kar la rahe the, to unhon ne use Hazrat Umar ke samne rakha, to Hazrat Umar ne apne ird gird ke kuch miskeen logon aur logon ke ghulamon me se kuch ghulamon ko bulaya, to unhon ne un ke sath khaya, phir us waqt kaha: Allah aisi qaum ka ye kare, ya kaha: Allah aisi qaum ko halak kare jo apne ghulamon se aar karte hain ke woh un ke sath khayen, to Safwan ne kaha: Khuda ki qasam hum un se aar nahi karte, lekin hum un par khud ko tarjih dete hain, Khuda ki qasam hum umda khana nahi pate ke hum khayen aur unhen khilayen."
"202","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se hadith bayan ki, Nafi se, Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Beshak ghulam jab apne aaqa ki khairkhwahi kare aur apne Rab ki ibadat achhi tarah baja laye, us ke liye us ka ajr do martaba hai."
"203","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muharibi ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Salih bin Hayy ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Aamir Shaabi se kaha: Ae Abu Amr, hamare han hamare paas ye baat bayan ki jati hai ke admi jab apni umm walad ko azad kare phir us se nikah kare to woh apni qurbani ke unt par sawar hone wale ki tarah hota hai, to Aamir ne kaha: Abu Burda ne mujh se hadith bayan ki, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne un se farmaya: Teen shakhs hain jin ke liye do ajr hain: Ahl kitab me se ek shakhs jo apne nabi par iman laya aur Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam par iman laya to us ke liye do ajr hain, aur mamluk ghulam jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqaon ka haq ada kare, aur ek shakhs jis ke paas ek laundi thi jis se woh hambistari karta tha, to us ne use adab sikhaya aur achhi tarah adab sikhaya, aur use taleem di aur achhi tarah taleem di, phir use azad kiya aur us se nikah kiya, to us ke liye do ajr hain, Aamir ne kaha: Hum ne tumhen ye baghair kisi cheez ke de di, halanke us se kamtar cheez ke liye Madina tak sawari ki jati thi."
"204","Muhammad bin Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Buraid bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Abu Burda se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Wo mamluk jo apne Rab ki ibadat khoobsurti se baja lata hai aur apne aaqa ko wo ada karta hai jo us par farz hai yani itaat aur khairkhwahi, us ke liye do ajr hain."
"205","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Burda bin Abdullah bin Abi Burda ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Burda ko bayan karte hue suna, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Mamluk ke liye do ajr hain jab wo Allah ka haq us ki ibadat me ada kare, ya unhon ne kaha: us ki ibadat ke husn me, aur apne malik ka haq ada kare jo us ka malik hai."
"206","Ismail bin Abi Uwais ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Umar se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Tum me se har ek nigran hai aur tum me se har ek se us ki riaya ke bare me sawal kiya jayega, pas ameer jo logon par hai wo nigran hai aur us se us ki riaya ke bare me sawal kiya jayega, aur aadmi apne ghar walon par nigran hai aur us se us ki riaya ke bare me sawal kiya jayega, aur aadmi ka ghulam apne aaqa ke maal par nigran hai aur us se us ke bare me sawal kiya jayega, khabardar tum me se har ek nigran hai aur tum me se har ek se us ki riaya ke bare me sawal kiya jayega."
"207","Ahmad bin Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Makhrama bin Bukair ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Saad se jo Hazrat Aisha jo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki zauja hain ke maula hain, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Abu Huraira ko kehte hue suna: Ghulam jab apne aaqa ki itaat kare to tehqeeq us ne Allah azza wa jal ki itaat ki, pas jab us ne apne aaqa ki nafarmani ki to tehqeeq us ne Allah azza wa jal ki nafarmani ki."
"208","Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Bilal ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yunus se, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Musalman ghulam jab Allah ka haq aur apne aaqa ka haq ada kare, us ke liye do ajr hain, aur qasam us Zaat ki jis ke hath me Abu Huraira ki jaan hai, agar Allah ke raste me jihad aur hajj aur meri walida se husn e suluk na hota to main pasand karta ke ghulam hote hue marun."
"209","Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Hazim ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ala se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se koi ye na kahe: mera banda, meri bandi, tum sab Allah ke bande ho aur tumhari tamam aurten Allah ki bandiyan hain, aur use kehna chahiye: mera ghulam, meri laundi, aur mera larka, aur meri larki."
"210","Hajjaj bin Minhal ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ayyub aur Habib aur Hisham se, unhon ne Muhammad se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Tum me se koi hargiz ye na kahe: mera banda aur meri bandi, aur mamluk hargiz ye na kahe: mera rab aur meri rabbi, aur use kehna chahiye: mera larka aur meri larki, aur mera sayyid aur meri sayyida, tum sab ke sab mamluk ho aur Rab Allah azza wa jal hai."
"211","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Bishr bin Fazl ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Maslama ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Nazra se, unhon ne Mutarrif se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne kaha: Main Banu Amir ke wafd me Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ki taraf rawana hua, to unhon ne kaha: Aap hamare sayyid hain, Aap ne farmaya: Sayyid Allah hai, unhon ne kaha: Aur fazl me hum me sab se afzal, aur ata me hum me sab se bara, kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Apni baat kaho aur shaitan tumhen hargiz na ubhare."
